abla F|^2 - E) \phi_{ oldsymbol{\alpha}} \= \sum_{\substack{ oldsymbol{\sigma} \le  oldsymbol{\alpha} \  oldsymbol{\sigma} 
e 0}} { oldsymbol{\alpha} \choose  oldsymbol{\sigma}}  ig( 2 D_{ old{P}}^{ oldsymbol{\sigma}} 
